  "text": "proprium.dominica-i-passionis-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “First Passion Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Be present with us, O Lord our God, and defend with perpetual aid those whom Thou hast refreshed by Thy mysteries. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
